OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy day with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain spreading north
OL,7,Fthrough the day, turning more showery
OL,8,Fand perhaps heavy at times in the
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with scattered showers
OL,12,Fat first, heavy at times, but these
OL,13,Fgradually fading out through the
OL,14,Fevening. Mostly dry overnight with
OL,15,Fvariable cloud and clear spells.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FAfter a mostly dry start it
OL,18,Fwill turn unsettled with showers or
OL,19,Flonger spells of rain, heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
