OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FQuite
OL,6,Fbreezy and cloudy as rain clears
OL,7,FThursday morning, then a mostly dry,
OL,8,Fbright afternoon. Bright start Friday,
OL,9,Fshowers later. Dry interludes between
OL,10,Fspells of showery rain on Saturday.
